*.bak*
.DS_Store
.cache/
portfolio_report.html

# Index membership fetched from Wikipedia by screener.fetch_sp500_sp400. Purely
# derived, and a committed copy would freeze the universe: the fetch reads this
# file instead of the network whenever it exists.
universe_cache.json
# Recommendation-history ledger for the Missed Opportunities section. Holds real
# allocations/holdings, so it stays out of this public repo — it persists across
# CI runs via the GitHub Actions cache instead (see .github/workflows/portfolio.yml).
recs_history.json

# Account-equity ledger for the cash-flow-adjusted YTD return. One equity value
# per day, used to pin the year-start anchor each January. Real account values,
# so like recs_history.json it stays out of this public repo and rides the CI
# cache (see .github/workflows/portfolio.yml).
equity_history.json

# Generated portfolio reports. These render real holdings and, since the
# deposit-adjusted YTD tile, real account equity and deposits — and this repo
# is public. CI builds report.html fresh each run and deploys it to Pages
# behind add_password_protection.py, so nothing needs a copy committed here.
# (report_protected.html's protection is client-side only: the holdings sit in
# the page as plaintext, so committing it published them.)
report.html
report_protected.html
